":ref:`TEMP1_BUS<TEMP1_BUS>` = the I2C port on which the sensor is attached "
"(0-3)."
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_BUS<TEMP1_BUS>` = 传感器所连接的 I2C 端口（0-3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:31
#: 08c690d72b6a4cac89303472fd3c9a1a 1dac97b1039b4c2abecb9a9133d8f6a9
#: 25654b908887435382724adb3fcd714e 6609881855f14ef09603dd691b13c48a
#: 8dcf947225f149689f8faac5600c29ff
