msgid ""
"Several peripherals have the possibility of reporting temperature if their "
"hardware permits: ESCs, EFIs, Smart Batteries, etc. However, if their "
"hardware does not include a temperature sensor, it's possible to redirect a "
"discrete temperature sensor's report to be included with another device's "
"report. We will use the first temperature sensor below as an example."
msgstr ""
"若硬件支持，多种外设可以报告温度：ESC、EFI、智能电池等。但如果其硬件不包含温度传感器，则可将独立温度传感器的数据重定向以包含在其他设备的报告中。以下以第一个温度传感器为例进行说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:76
#: 041962c7f717476a89b25ea0ab667274 1696ee7500ea499fb16ad2b521a06b99
#: 1f2f4e94e8fc43c18bc711d25a9ed0bf 7f5c427b79764753b2c022240ee756df
#: dd20e82e6c784eb08ef44e57d330e14c
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC<TEMP1_SRC>` will designate which device's temperature report"
" will be replaced by this temperature sensor's data. ie: if set to 1, then "
"an ESC's report of temperature(usually null due to lack of hardware "
"capability)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC<TEMP1_SRC>` 用于指定哪个设备的温度报告将被该温度传感器的数据替换。例如：若设为 1，则 ESC "
"的温度报告（通常因缺乏硬件支持而为空）将被替换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:77
#: 12780100b330464ba0ea550c3fdcb31b 1fe336bc1966491d82dd1db0153f016e
#: 419414d064b74b078084c5b1eb540a75 66b4ad4872fe4c3f8cc9192794e449ca
#: c205fa72d0be4acabef91d1124d67eac
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC_ID<TEMP1_SRC_ID>` replaces a specific instance of a system "
"component's temperature report with this temp sensor's. ie: if set to 4, "
"with the above param set to 1, the fourth instance of an ESC (ie 4th "
"motor/servo output with a motor/throttle function) will have its temperature"
" report replaced."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC_ID<TEMP1_SRC_ID>` 用于将系统某组件特定实例的温度报告替换为该温度传感器的数据。例如：若设为 "
"4，且上述参数设为 1，则第四个 ESC 实例（即第4个具有电机/油门功能的电机/舵机输出）的温度报告将被替换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:79
#: 0dbe65431a834654a72f3c4dba2d3fc5 7b5a0d081aea4f239252a02adac3b607
#: bf1a0a2a3285499da85d13087f09bd27 f6d1da1ea62b44ff9fcf6513973ac074
#: ff3f6c11400045a9aeae9780e4ad7ec1
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP_LOG<TEMP_LOG>` = 0: No logging, 1: Log temperature reports from "
"all temperature sensors, including those also being reported in other device"
" reports, 2: Only those with ``TEMPx_SRC`` set to NONE, eg. not being logged"
" elsewhere."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TEMP_LOG<TEMP_LOG>` = "
"0：不记录日志；1：记录所有温度传感器的温度报告，包括同时在其他设备报告中记录的传感器；2：仅记录 ``TEMPx_SRC`` 设为 NONE "
"的传感器，即未在其他地方记录的传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:8
#: 25b9f0939c7244b39e8086256d720d55 45d49fb009514489aee0160acd4f2ca3
#: a8f5974f6bf84ed2990bb49ab36f204c d953c4af03c646fcb631e81e84692cd1
msgid "ArduPilot supports up to 15 individual temperature sensors:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 最多支持 15 个独立的温度传感器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:32
#: 22c4a4935bad49f294ec1a7d54a417d0 7ffccb94bbc54cb088bfe790c140461d
#: ba8cf8d6eb814003be45467524da9f06 e385f9b6caf14b77b55de1cad55cdbae
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC<TEMP1_SRC>` = the temperature reporting device type that "
"should have its temperature report replaced with this sensor's. (Optional)"
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_SRC<TEMP1_SRC>` = 应由本传感器温度替换其温度报告的设备类型。（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:33
#: 163aa4a9538f46308de63511b23e41b4 2e3ad93df62b4726a124e8cf93edb832
#: f1ff2f05a04f401aa4ebdac8a34e2148 fad85cee76d04337b754d8075fa82efe
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC_ID<TEMP1_SRC_ID>` = identifies the individual device, of the"
" above type, that should have its report replaced. (Optional)"
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_SRC_ID<TEMP1_SRC_ID>` = 指定上述类型中应被替换报告的具体设备。（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:72
#: 0622e0bbb0ef4ddcb3e28c678e1b8e73 45807ba0f9bc455f9dbb916d46ee0e79
#: d104e65156f54389aeddd824f19c70a9 d9ce656412a0483595db8473be22fc0e
msgid "Logging/OSD"
msgstr "日志记录/OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:74
#: 4a5f4b0f7bc0418c9440ee902d99c652 51cdd71c38dc4598aa8246e943e6dbaf
#: 898e454a65e541799aad70b0720da410 983dcc7fd5e944ada84f98fc00cd98a9
msgid ""
"Several peripherals have the possibility of reporting temperature if their "
"hardware permits: ESCs, EFIs, Smart Batteries, etc. However, if their "
"hardware does not include a temperature sensor, it's possible to redirect a "
"discrete temperature sensor's report to be included with another device's "
"report. We will use the first temperature sensor below as an example. This "
"also allows the OSD ESC or Airspeed (if DroneCAN) temperature panel to be "
"used for OSD display of the temperature sensor if an ESC temperature is not "
"being reported."
msgstr ""
"多种外设在硬件允许的情况下可以报告温度：电调、EFI、智能电池等。但如果其硬件不含温度传感器，可以将一个独立温度传感器的报告重定向，使其包含在另一设备的报告中。下文以第一个温度传感器为例。这也使得在未报告电调温度时，可用"
" OSD 的电调或空速（若为 DroneCAN）温度面板在 OSD 上显示该温度传感器的读数。"
